flowchart LR
  subgraph U[Internal User]
    A([Start]) --> B[Create Tender in Draft]
    B --> C[Upload RFQ Documents]
    C --> D[Submit]
    D --> E[Verify]
    E --> F[Approve]
    F --> G[Publish]
  end
  subgraph B1[Odoo Backend]
    D --> H{Checks Pass?}
    H -->|No| X[Show Validation Error]
    H -->|Yes| I[draft to submit]
    E --> J[submit to verify]
    F --> K[verify to approve]
    G --> L[approve to open]
    L --> M[Set website published flags]
  end
  subgraph W[Website]
    M --> N[Tender listed on website pages]
    N --> O([End])
  end
